      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So they're supposedly working on testing changes.... I do genuinely hope this isn't just lip service from whoever is calling the shots behind the scenes.\n\nI'll be blunt. I know it costs money to run and develop a game. But pushing monetization through annoying ui changes and dark patterns? That's the  kind of behavior you'd see out of a lot of mobile games, and it's one of the many reasons i stopped playing them. That and the premium currency, or the urge to paywall things. I really just don't want to see this game turn into the equivalent to one of those predatory mobile games.",
